The themes in this repository are forks of the @myst-theme site themes:
themes/book derives from @myst-theme/book and themes/article derives from
@myst-theme/article (both vendored at v1.3.1, with local modifications — ASTRA
integration, deduplication, and performance cleanups). The following files
remain under the MIT License:

  themes/*/app/root.tsx
  themes/*/app/entry.client.tsx
  themes/*/app/entry.server.tsx
  themes/*/app/types.ts
  themes/*/app/routes/**
  themes/*/app/components/**
  themes/*/app/utils/**
  themes/*/styles/**
  server.js
  themes/*/remix.config.prod.js, themes/*/remix.config.dev.js
  themes/*/tailwind.config.js, themes/*/tsconfig.json, themes/*/remix.env.d.ts,
  .eslintrc.js

The themes also depend on the published @myst-theme/* npm packages
(@myst-theme/site, @myst-theme/providers, myst-to-react, etc.), each under their
own licenses (MIT), resolved at install time.

The ASTRA-specific code — packages/astra/** (the ASTRA overlay, including
styles/astra.css), packages/store-types, and this repository's configuration
and documentation — is original work under the BSD 3-Clause License.

